// The washout repo's gravity, shared by the golden-case sims.
//
// The golden runs they are overlaid on were made with the washout repo's
// default, g = 9.81 m/s^2; `Classical` defaults to standard gravity, 9.80665.
// The difference is small, but it is in every tilt angle (asin(a/g)), in the -g
// inside `sf` and in the gravity term that cancels it, so it would be a real, if
// tiny, disagreement that has nothing to do with the model.
//
// One setting: `Classical` flows `grav.z` down into `TiltCalc`'s `G`, so this
// reaches the lean as well. `grav` is a record, and an override addresses one
// field of it at a time (SE0460); only Z is nonzero.
wash.grav.z = 9.81 (m/s^2);
